If the phone booth is locked the, it will require a skeleton key to open 
it, and it will not have a phone inside. Instead it will lead to a new 
dungeon. A preset place like the castle, it can only be entered through 
the phone book. Here you will can find the sonic-screwdrive, which can 
cast an infinite number of knock spells. You may also find another locked 
phone booth here, but this is rare, it will lead to a simmilar level that 
is ruled by and evil master. 

